    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "81220b9194e5258f",
      "translationZh": "Palo Alto Networks 收购 AI 智能体平台 Console",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c11a98fdc0a6209e",
      "translationZh": "这家网络安全巨头在宣布此次收购的同时发布了季度业绩，数据显示营收增长34%，下一代安全业务的年度经常性收入（ARR）强劲增长。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f09d3efa5a7070c8",
      "translationZh": "| 2026年9月1日（美国东部时间下午4:29）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c846a07d69a61e0f",
      "translationZh": "分享到Facebook：https://news.google.?oc=5# 将本文发到推特：https://news.google.?oc=5#",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "76384226625024e5",
      "translationZh": "Flipboard · Reddit · Whatsapp · Whatsapp · 电子邮件",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0dce504b2e82fb7a",
      "translationZh": "Palo Alto Networks（NASDAQ: PANW）周二宣布，已收购Console。这是一个AI原生平台，旨在帮助组织使用自然语言构建智能体工作流，并实现运营任务的自动化。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "34f5efd3542be214",
      "translationZh": "这家网络安全巨头表示，Console将增强其Cortex平台的智能体能力，使安全团队能够调查信号、确定工作的优先级，并在企业环境中自动采取行动。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "08c313fa901c2801",
      "translationZh": "Console的技术使用户能够用自然语言描述运营目标，随后由AI智能体处理实现该目标所需的分析和行动。Palo Alto Networks表示，这可以帮助组织以机器速度处理告警、问题和请求。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4f51be56c0b527ce",
      "translationZh": "首席执行官Nikesh Arora表示：“通过将Console纳入Palo Alto Networks，我们的客户可以直接与数据对话，并用自然语言构建智能体工作流，帮助自动发出告警并修复问题。”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "84dcbbe93dc79ed1",
      "translationZh": "该交易的财务条款未予披露。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "60e3430710fa51f0",
      "translationZh": "此次收购公告与 Palo Alto Networks 的 2026 财年第四季度财务业绩一同发布。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6d3991d94498936c",
      "translationZh": "广告。向下滚动以继续阅读。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e13357810532837d",
      "translationZh": "截至 July 31 的季度，营收同比增长 34%，达到 3.41 十亿，而剩余履约义务增长 34%，达到 21.2 十亿。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6649e3fb438eda73",
      "translationZh": "该公司报告，按 GAAP 计算的净亏损为 282 百万，摊薄后每股亏损为 35 美分，而上年同期的净利润为 254 百万。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cb21880ced6c18c4",
      "translationZh": "Palo Alto Networks 表示，该季度下一代安全业务的净新增 ARR 接近 1 十亿。该公司预计，2027 财年营收将在 14.1 十亿至 14.2 十亿之间，增幅为 23% 至 24%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dca97e6b510b9d24",
      "translationZh": "作者：SecurityWeek News",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
